          "claim": "Travel-plan's GET calls to train-service take about 615 ms on the caller while the train server span takes 3.7 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT substr(CAST(time AS VARCHAR),1,16) mins, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) tp_get_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND span_name='GET' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "The travel-plan GET delay stays at about 611-620 ms in every minute of the incident window, a steady per-path hold."
